WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:01.910
Coach Trey here with
the Hope Project.

2
00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:04.550
It is time for your
spiritual workout of the day.

3
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:10.130
It is our last training
session focused on grace.

4
00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:15.250
And today we're gonna think
about grace as a blessing.

5
00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:18.930
And there's gonna be a
very specific blessing

6
00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:22.970
that the Lord is going
to speak to you today.

7
00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:26.810
This is a blessing that comes
from the Old Testament book of

8
00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:31.210
Numbers. And this is a blessing
that God spoke through Moses to

9
00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:33.810
the nation of Israel.

10
00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:37.490
And I believe today that the
Lord is going to speak this

11
00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:41.010
blessing to you as well.

12
00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:43.810
And today in this training block,
you're going to do two things.

13
00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:48.450
The first one is a really,
really fun discipline called Sabbath

14
00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:51.970
Scripture. And so if you're not
familiar with Sabbath Scripture,

15
00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:55.810
think about Sabbath like
pausing, resting, stopping.

16
00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:58.930
And so today, what I'm going to
want you to do in that time of

17
00:00:58.980 --> 00:01:01.970
training is I just want you to
read the blessings of today's

18
00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:04.440
verse (I'll have it right
there for you on the screen)

19
00:01:04.810 --> 00:01:09.240
slowly, and just as a
restful close to the month.

20
00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:11.160
I'm not asking you to study.

21
00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:12.600
I'm not asking you to consider.

22
00:01:12.650 --> 00:01:13.960
I'm not asking you to reflect.

23
00:01:14.010 --> 00:01:16.200
I'm just asking you to read.

24
00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:19.480
And today, would you, as you
read, would you just hear these

25
00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:22.920
blessings as God's
word spoken over you?

26
00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:25.160
And then you're going to finish
today with a time of prayer,

27
00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:28.040
looking back across the month,
a little bit of reflection,

28
00:01:28.090 --> 00:01:31.560
thinking about places where
God's grace has changed you.

29
00:01:31.610 --> 00:01:33.400
And then, of course,
we always want the same thing.

30
00:01:33.450 --> 00:01:38.370
What area of growth can
we carry into next month?

31
00:01:38.420 --> 00:01:39.970
Great training session.

32
00:01:40.020 --> 00:01:41.090
Can't wait to get you there.

33
00:01:41.140 --> 00:01:43.810
But before I get you there,
I want to get you ready to get you

34
00:01:43.860 --> 00:01:46.450
there. So take your feet,
put them firmly on the ground.

35
00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:48.590
Take a nice, big,
deep breath for me.

36
00:01:51.370 --> 00:01:53.800
As you exhale, just
open those hands up.

37
00:01:53.850 --> 00:01:58.680
Just letting go. Just
trusting by faith, God's plan.

38
00:01:58.730 --> 00:02:01.460
And today we just want to receive.

39
00:02:01.530 --> 00:02:03.400
And we're always going
to receive some truth.

40
00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:04.600
You're going to receive
some truth today.

41
00:02:04.650 --> 00:02:06.760
So just take your hands,
place them over your heart.

42
00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:10.040
I want you to receive
this blessing today.

43
00:02:10.090 --> 00:02:14.520
Numbers 6:24–26,
our verse of the day.

44
00:02:14.570 --> 00:02:19.420
The Lord bless you
and keep you; the Lord

45
00:02:19.470 --> 00:02:24.320
make his face shine
on you and be gracious

46
00:02:24.370 --> 00:02:29.220
to you; the Lord turn
his face toward you

47
00:02:29.270 --> 00:02:31.560
and give you peace.

48
00:02:31.610 --> 00:02:34.280
That's what I'm praying today:
that the Lord would do all of

49
00:02:34.330 --> 00:02:37.000
those things in that blessing as
you're just going to speak that

50
00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:39.000
over your life. Take your
hands, lift them high.

51
00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:41.300
One more big, deep breath.

52
00:02:43.050 --> 00:02:44.920
Alright, it's time to go to work.

53
00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:46.434
Let's train the soul.

